exports[`the assistant on each page > in a panel with threads attached 1`] = `"<div class="flex flex-col min-h-0 h-full"><div class="flex-1 min-h-0 overflow-y-auto px-2"><div class="py-10 px-4 text-center max-w-lg mx-auto"><h3 class="text-base font-semibold tracking-tight text-foreground">How can I help you today?</h3><p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground mt-1 leading-relaxed">I can read, search and organize your mail, screen senders, and write drafts for you to send.</p><div class="mt-6 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-2 text-left"><button type="button" class="p-3 rounded-xl border border-border/70 bg-card/60 hover:bg-muted/80 hover:border-primary/40 hover:shadow-xs transition-all text-left group outline-none focus-visible:ring-1 focus-visible:ring-ring cursor-pointer"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-xs font-semibold text-foreground group-hover:text-primary transition-colors truncate">What is the deadline?</span></div><p class="text-[11px] text-muted-foreground mt-1 line-clamp-1">Find asks, deadlines and next steps in this thread</p></button><button type="button" class="p-3 rounded-xl border border-border/70 bg-card/60 hover:bg-muted/80 hover:border-primary/40 hover:shadow-xs transition-all text-left group outline-none focus-visible:ring-1 focus-visible:ring-ring cursor-pointer"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-xs font-semibold text-foreground group-hover:text-primary transition-colors truncate">Catch me up</span></div><p class="text-[11px] text-muted-foreground mt-1 line-clamp-1">Summarize recent messages and agreements</p></button><button type="button" class="p-3 rounded-xl border border-border/70 bg-card/60 hover:bg-muted/80 hover:border-primary/40 hover:shadow-xs transition-all text-left group outline-none focus-visible:ring-1 focus-visible:ring-ring cursor-pointer"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-xs font-semibold text-foreground group-hover:text-primary transition-colors truncate">Draft a